<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50987" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἶσις</span></b> , ἡ, voc. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἶσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>UPZ</u>
					81 ii 19
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴσιδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					993ii10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.353f
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				Ion.
			 and later 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴσιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.41
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.216
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, etc. (written 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔσιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Schwyzer</u>
					749
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(v B.C.)</span>), dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴσιδι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					175.4
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, etc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴσῑ</span> or 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.59
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				61.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἶσιν</span>:—<u>Isis</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> Il.cc., <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				2.1.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.351f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1380
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴσιδος
				τρίχες</span>, name of a <i>plant</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.939d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				13.142
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> name of a
				<i>plaster</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.126
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				13.774
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pythag.
			</span></i> name for the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυάς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
				12
			</span></i>.</div>
